+
+An experiment-only timing overlay recognizes `KUNA_EXPERIMENT_ATOMIC_TIMING=1`
+only with atomic capture enabled. It records sequential per-function wall times
+to stderr for the decompile drive, pre-render metadata, C rendering, metadata
+extraction, membership, calls, full graph, projection and metadata tail. It does
+not change analysis parameters or JSON facts. Loading, setup and final JSON
+encoding are outside these phase intervals; phase CPU costs are not measured.
